@ahahamyan sorry I'm just getting caught up after the holidays.

New features are only added to the 2nd level versions.  3rd level versions are just for quick bug fixes.  This didn't make it into 2021.12 so it has to wait to 2022.2.  See https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/2021.12.7/homeassistant/components/totalconnect showing the last commit in October.

Also a quick note for you:  when I was building the new code I initially used `arm_stay_instant` because that was the Total Connect / Honeywell term.  Later I changed it to `arm_home_instant` to be more consistent with the Home Assistant terminology.  Since you were helping me, you may have to manually change that in YAML mode (after the new code is available).
